# Types live in `types.ts`

In `apps/web` slices/segments, put **all** `interface` / `type` declarations in that folder’s `types.ts` — not in `view.tsx`, `model.ts`, or `lib/*`.

```ts
// ✅ types.ts
export type TagProps = PropsWithChildren<ClassNameProps>;

// ✅ view.tsx
import type { TagProps } from './types';

// ❌ view.tsx
export interface TagProps { … }
```

Prefer utility types (`Pick`, `Omit`, `PropsWithChildren`, …) over hand-written field lists.
